    "text": {
     "en": "To make recycled paper, tear old paper into small bits and soak them in water.\nBlend them into pulp. Spread the pulp thin on a mesh and press out water.\nDry it in the sun to get new paper.\nPottery uses clay, shaped on a wheel and baked in a kiln.\nBoth turn raw materials into useful things."
    }
